	<string>Ant Manager reads your calendar events to record meetings as evidence of your work. Nothing leaves your Mac unless you choose an AI provider.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ant Manager reads your calendar events to record meetings as evidence of your work. Nothing leaves your Mac unless you choose an AI provider.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ant Manager connects to AI models and git servers on your local network when you configure them.</string>
